 <div class="grid g2" style="align-items:start;margin-bottom:18px"><section class="card glass"><div class="cardhead"><div><h3>Cost by kind of work</h3><span class="muted small">All requests in the funnel, in thousands of dollars</span></div></div>${bars(wkItems,v=>K$(v))}</section>${trigStrip()||`<section class="card glass"><div class="cardhead"><div><h3>Demand that creates itself</h3><span class="muted small" data-role="story">Triggers from unit-cost models, service levels, change reviews and maturity gaps add requests here. None waiting right now.</span></div></div><div class="row"><button class="btn" data-ppm-tab="port:4">See the triggers</button>${stdChip("tbm","Scale up and scale down triggers read the Technology Business Management (TBM) unit-cost model, so capacity decisions start as scored requests.")}</div></section>`}</div>
